# --curl pin (WI-0013 sem-S6 + review F2/F4): --proxy entries become
# env prefixes — all: -> all_proxy (curl's -x would override scheme
# envs), first entry wins per proto. Ambient no_proxy is cleared so
# the emitted curl can't bypass a proxy oxttp itself would use.
argv: --curl --proxy all:http://anyp:8080 --proxy http:http://hprox:3128 --proxy https:http://sprox:3129 GET https://example.org/
